#40903
A westerly bend in the Northern Road~
   The road here turns slightly to the west for those heading north.  The trees
aren't so thick at this spot, and evidence of campfires in times past can be
seen off to the side of the road.  It looks like a good spot to stop if you
need to stop for the night.    
