#40906
A covered bridge along the Northern Road~
   This bridge crosses a rushing river that would be impossible to cross by
fording or even by boat.  The wood of the bridge is old, and the ceiling is
high overhead.  You can see through the many holes in the planks, and gaps in
the floor.    
