#40911
The main room of the Regtorth's Wayhouse~
   This wayhouse is built mostly for giants, but it seems that all types are
gathered here to relax after a long days work.  The wayhouse seems to be a
collecting place for all those who are travelling the northern roads as well as
for those who live in the area.  The walls of the room show evidence of many
fights gotten out of hand, and it is apparent that the atmosphere of this place
could easily get out of hand.  Sounds of the kitchen can be heard to the west,
and a staircase leads up.    
~
