#40912
The kitchen of Regtorth's Wayhouse~
   There isn't much here in the kitchen, except for a grill where the beef
sandwiches are prepared, which looks awfully dirty.  Kegs of ale and the house
drink are stored along the walls here, but are mounted firmly so they cannot be
taken.  The smell of roasting beef fills the room.    
~
