#40916
A Small Bedroom~
   This room is obviously for those guests who have less money.  As with the
other rooms, the bed is huge, sized for a giant.  A small washbasin is in this
room against one wall, and there are no windows.  The floor is wooden, strewn
with straw.  An odd smell permeates this room.    
